{# This is the LLMT Template for generating feature files #}
{# It must be redered following the instructions defined in the `../../agile-ddd-update/references/LLMT-COMPILER.md` file #}
{# MANDATORY: the {{ id }} is a 6-digit ID (with leading zeroes) and {{ title }} is the feature title (lowercase, hyphens). Example: `ft-000001-vite-migration` #}
# Feature: ft-{{ id }}: {{ title }}

## Description

{# Something like: This is my awesome feature that does this, for solving that problem. #}
{{ description }}

## User Stories
{# Related user stories #}
{# A table with columns: ID, STATUS, Title
Example:
| ID     | STATUS        | Title                          |
|--------|---------------|--------------------------------|
| st-000000 | DONE          | This is the first user story   |
| st-000001 | IN-PROGRESS   | This is the second user story  |
| st-000002 | NOT-STARTED   | This is the third user story   |
...
| st-00000N | NOT-STARTED   | This is the last user story    |
#}

| ID     | STATUS        | Title                          |
|--------|---------------|--------------------------------|
{% for userStory in userStories %}
| {{ userStory.id }} | {{ userStory.status }} | {{ userStory.title }} |
{% endfor %}

## Status

{# Feature status - Default to NOT-STARTED #}
**{{ status }}**

## Comments
{# Optional: Comments from agents or user, it must be brief and concise #}
{# A table with columns:
    - Agent: [agentName] like `/agile-feature-add` or `/agile-story-add` or [userName]
    - Coding Agent: [codingAgent] like `Cursor`, `Codex`, `Claude Code`, `Pi`, `others`]
    - Datetime: [date] in format `YYYY-MM-DD - HH:MM:SS` like `2000-01-01 - 12:00:00`
    - Comment: [comment] like `Added this feature` or `User updated this feature` or `Sliced this feature`
Example:
| Agent                    | Coding Agent  | Datetime              | Comment                |
|--------------------------|---------------|-----------------------|------------------------|
| `/agile-feature-add`     | `/agile-feature-add`  | 2000-01-01 - 12:00:00 | Added this feature |
| `User`                 | `User`               | 2000-01-01 - 12:00:00 | User updated this feature |
| `/agile-feature-slice` | `/agile-feature-slice`| 2000-01-01 - 12:00:00 | Sliced this feature |
| `/agile-story-add`     | `/agile-story-add`   | 2000-01-01 - 12:00:00 | Added user story `st-000001`: [Title] |
...
| `/agile-story-done`    | `/agile-story-done`  | 2000-01-01 - 12:00:00 | User story `st-000001`: [Title] is done |
| `User`                 | `User`               | 2000-01-01 - 12:00:00 | Feature is done |
#}

| Agent                    | Coding Agent  | Datetime              | Comment                |
|--------------------------|---------------|-----------------------|------------------------|
{% for comment in comments %}
| {{ comment.agent }} | {{ comment.codingAgent }} | {{ comment.datetime }} | {{ comment.comment }} |
{% endfor %}
